{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_8455",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A biguanide compound which has isopropyl and <em>p</em>-chlorophenyl substituents on the terminal N atoms. A prophylactic antimalarial drug, it works by inhibiting the enzyme dihydrofolate reductase, which is involved in the reproduction of the malaria parasites <em>Plasmodium falciparum</em> and <em>P. vivax</em> within the red blood cells."
  ],
